### Explainable Diabetic Retinopathy Detection using Deep Learning

**Authors:**  
Pranav Vinod Chaudhari, Devyani Prakash Badgujar, 
Mandar Ravindra Visave, Akanksha Bharat Chaudhari, 
Manisha Shantaram Patil

**Journal:** International Research Journal of Engineering and Technology (IRJET)  
**Volume:** 12  
**Issue:** 06  
**Publication:** June 2025  

**Research Area:** Deep Learning, Medical Image Analysis, 
Diabetic Retinopathy, Explainable AI

### Abstract

This research presents a deep learning-based approach for automated
detection of diabetic retinopathy from retinal fundus images. The
study focuses on applying deep learning techniques to classify
retinal images and identify patterns associated with different
stages of diabetic retinopathy. Explainable AI techniques are
incorporated to improve the interpretability of model predictions
by highlighting important regions of retinal images. The proposed
approach demonstrates the potential of deep learning and explainable
AI for supporting automated and transparent analysis of retinal
medical images.
